{"2178990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sodaman", "steam_appid": 2178990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/2cd6e83af53d25b0f9fd56ebae346ffe.poster.avif?t=1785769601\" width=780 height=3800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/2cd6e83af53d25b0f9fd56ebae346ffe.webm?t=1785769601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/2cd6e83af53d25b0f9fd56ebae346ffe.mp4?t=1785769601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>''Sodaman is infuriated, ever since Entity-X caused the Sodacalypse, making almost all of the sodas in the existence go flat, becoming bland and tasteless with the press of a button. Yet there are still some out there, untouched by this catastrophe and it is up to Sodaman himself to find them.&quot;</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I'm here to drink soda and kick aliens... but I'm all outta soda.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chug Sodas Down </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from a variety of soda powers across 7 different colors, mix, shake, add a little dash of fury and create the freshest builds found in this side of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arm Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose the weapon most suited to your playstyle and discover the most powerful synergies. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Augment Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With six different body parts and over 30 cybernetic augments available for implementation, you'll have endless options for character customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from dozens of power-up cards and build your deck. Take your soda power to the next level!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Your Spaceship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relax between runs in your spaceship, meet new characters and explore more of the Sodaman universe.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/e9c8ef949c21e7555181f4bde69f77a4.poster.avif?t=1785769601\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/e9c8ef949c21e7555181f4bde69f77a4.webm?t=1785769601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We’re a small team of 4 devs creating the game. So if you have any question, suggestions or just want to hang out, grab a six-pack and join our Discord.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/2cd6e83af53d25b0f9fd56ebae346ffe.poster.avif?t=1785769601\" width=780 height=3800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/2cd6e83af53d25b0f9fd56ebae346ffe.webm?t=1785769601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/2cd6e83af53d25b0f9fd56ebae346ffe.mp4?t=1785769601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>''Sodaman is infuriated, ever since Entity-X caused the Sodacalypse, making almost all of the sodas in the existence go flat, becoming bland and tasteless with the press of a button. Yet there are still some out there, untouched by this catastrophe and it is up to Sodaman himself to find them.&quot;</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I'm here to drink soda and kick aliens... but I'm all outta soda.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chug Sodas Down </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from a variety of soda powers across 7 different colors, mix, shake, add a little dash of fury and create the freshest builds found in this side of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arm Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose the weapon most suited to your playstyle and discover the most powerful synergies. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Augment Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With six different body parts and over 30 cybernetic augments available for implementation, you'll have endless options for character customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from dozens of power-up cards and build your deck. Take your soda power to the next level!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Your Spaceship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relax between runs in your spaceship, meet new characters and explore more of the Sodaman universe.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/e9c8ef949c21e7555181f4bde69f77a4.poster.avif?t=1785769601\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/extras/e9c8ef949c21e7555181f4bde69f77a4.webm?t=1785769601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We’re a small team of 4 devs creating the game. So if you have any question, suggestions or just want to hang out, grab a six-pack and join our Discord.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sodaman is a bullet-heaven roguelike where you play as a supersoldier fighting alien hordes with soda powers. Find game-breaking sodas and concoct custom cocktails. Discover planets, unlock weapons, sodas, cybernetics, power-up cards, and more. But first, crack open a cold one.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/943a80c8fea32bc18a6176d123a8c13c89274604/header.jpg?t=1785769601", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/a69446be386c1f147f095368b0138679e716b962/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785769601", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178990/a69446be386c1f147f095368b0138679e716b962/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785769601", "website": "https://www.tapecorps.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce GT 730<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Not Specified</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel + Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Not Specified</li></ul>"}, "linux